      "message": "While this prevents rebuilding while pruning, it does not prevent pruning while rebuilding. It may make more sense to force a prune before rebuilding instead of trying to make them \"dodge\" each other. I guess this depends a little on whether pruning is now (since H2 is multi-threaded) something that we consider more safe to run at any time, such as during peak loads (with H2 v1 this has been disastrous for us with large caches)?",
